> > > > > >
> > > > > >
> > > > > >
> > > > > >
> > > > > >
> > > > > > 2. I have read your thought about using multiple trees. I will like to run the analysis using multiple trees from BEAST (Reviewer´s suggestions) and compare with the results from the standard (MCC tree) but I cannot until the DIVALIKE run is finished.  I will try the example data once the Divalike is done and hope it goes smoothly. Only then will I try my own data.
> > > > > >
> > > > > > I have also tried o search for nay published paper using multiple Beast trees for the Biogeo analyses. but not seen any. Do you know of any such paper.
